title Runner End-to-End Sequence (runner.ipynb)

participant Engineer
participant Notebook
participant Pipeline as managers/runner_pipeline_manager.py
participant MetadataAccessor
participant TaxonomyAccessor
participant Processor as MetadataMappingEngine
participant Cache
participant Results
participant Logs
participant AlphaManager
participant AbundanceManager

Engineer->Notebook: Set view_name and execute notebook
Notebook->Pipeline: initialize_runner_context(view_name)
Pipeline->Logs: Create new run_<timestamp>.log
Pipeline->Pipeline: Return RunnerContext + RunLogger

Notebook->Pipeline: prepare_workspace_inputs(context)
Pipeline->MetadataAccessor: Load metadata CSV parts
Pipeline->TaxonomyAccessor: Load taxonomy CSV parts
Pipeline->Pipeline: Aggregate and deduplicate
Pipeline->Results: Write canonical workspace inputs

Notebook->Pipeline: refresh_mapping_templates(metadata_df)
Pipeline->Processor: refresh_template(project_id, view_name)
Pipeline->Results: Update *.json.template files

Notebook->Pipeline: run_enrichment_stage(...)
Pipeline->Cache: Check enrichment stamp + artifacts
Pipeline->Processor: process project metadata where config exists
Pipeline->Results: Save enriched metadata + mapped columns

Notebook->Pipeline: enrich_envo_columns(...)
Pipeline->Results: Write ENVO_Term_Dictionary.csv

Notebook->Pipeline: run_taxonomy_stage(...)
Pipeline->Cache: Check taxonomy stamp
Pipeline->Results: Save abundance matrix + taxon lookup

Notebook->Pipeline: run_merge_stage(...)
Pipeline->Cache: Check merge stamp
Pipeline->Results: Save Ask_SLM_Analysis_Wide_Dataset.csv

Notebook->Pipeline: build_or_load_tax_accessor(...)
Pipeline->Cache: Reuse or build lineage DB

Notebook->AlphaManager: run()
Notebook->AbundanceManager: run()